config BR2_PACKAGE_LIBMPIX
	bool "libmpix"
	help
	  Library for Microcontroller Pixel processing.

	  libmpix is a C library designed for efficient pixel processing
	  on microcontrollers. It provides optimized functions for image
	  manipulation, format conversion, and pixel operations suitable
	  for embedded systems with limited resources.

	  Features:
	  - JPEG encoding support
	  - Media conversion utilities
	  - Optimized for microcontroller environments
	  - Low-level API for maximum flexibility

	  https://github.com/libmpix/libmpix
